{"id":7092,"chapter_id":7,"scene_id":711,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"朦胧的声音","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>呜呜呜……好痛……痛痛……</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"朦胧的声音","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>哈梅尔……要保护哈梅尔……不能让人类伤害哈梅尔……</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"你想挥手驱散阻碍你的东西，却发现自己凭空穿了过去，你伤不了它，它也触碰不到你。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"——这是禁闭者的力量吗？","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"朦胧的声音","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>哈梅尔……哈梅尔…………</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"湖心的舞者还在回旋，她的身体透出微光，保护了那些幻影。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"选项","options":["……你在保护它们吗？"],"jump":[8],"style":6,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"她没有回答，也没有停步。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"选项","options":["靠近她"],"jump":[10],"style":6,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"你独自走向湖心，穿过白色的幻影来到哈梅尔面前。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"近看，她比照片中的人更成熟一些，温和，宁静，没有任何恶意，也对你的到来无动于衷。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"你抬起手。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"朦胧的声音","content":"<color=#7683a2><i>不要……不要……哈梅尔……哈梅尔！</color></size></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"你的手碰到她了，枷锁发动，可你的手只穿过她的身体，红光映照着虚无。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"选项","options":["你也是幻觉……？"],"jump":[17],"style":6,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"哈梅尔没有回答，她的裙摆拂过你，竟带走了你身上所有疲惫。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"content":"她在……治愈你？","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"黑色的“哈梅尔”也是幻觉，眼前的哈梅尔也是幻觉。是枷锁的指引错了吗？本体究竟在哪儿？黑环的主人在哪里？","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"？？？","content":"放弃吧，你无法打扰她。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"选项","options":["是谁？！"],"jump":[22],"style":6,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"你的身后，出现了另一个陌生的傀儡。在你刚要抵抗时，它微微抬手，护在你身前的禁闭者幻影随之消散。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不过是幻境中心凝聚出来的思念幻影，并不是你的同伴。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112023"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"？？？","content":"这是她的舞台，我们深爱她，守护她。孤独一人的你，战胜不了哈梅尔。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7112024"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1}]}